    {
      "subId": "7053701",
      "subQuestName": "(test)调查木箱$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705371201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705371201": {
            "id": "705371201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "哈哈！是炸弹！我要玩！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371202"
            ]
          },
          "705371202": {
            "id": "705371202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你怎么突然兴奋起来了？现在还不知道这些炸弹的威力有多大呢，万一伤到无辜路人就不妙了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371205"
            ]
          },
          "705371205": {
            "id": "705371205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "噫！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371206"
            ]
          },
          "705371206": {
            "id": "705371206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "被你这么一说，我也有点心痒痒了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371207"
            ]
          },
          "705371207": {
            "id": "705371207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "平常总是听说，可莉想炸鱼，在炸鱼，炸了鱼，然后因此受了罚…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371208"
            ]
          },
          "705371208": {
            "id": "705371208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "结果自己身边放着一箱炸弹，站在湖边的时候…确实也想试试看！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371209"
            ]
          },
          "705371209": {
            "id": "705371209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "只是扔一个的话…应该不要紧吧？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7053701",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705370101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705370101": {
            "id": "705370101",
            "speakerId": 30415,
            "speakerName": "可疑的木箱",
            "text": "以前没有见过的可疑木箱，箱子盖板的缝隙里夹着一张纸条，写着「调查小队所属设备，最高等级危险品，轻拿轻放」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7053711",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705371101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705371101": {
            "id": "705371101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "姑且研究一下…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371102"
            ]
          },
          "705371102": {
            "id": "705371102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这个箱子上的留言…听起来很吓人！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371103"
            ]
          },
          "705371103": {
            "id": "705371103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "明明是危险品，却被放在果酒湖边？难道是那边那两个骑士的东西？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371104"
            ]
          },
          "705371104": {
            "id": "705371104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "木板上好像有个很宽的缝，可以看到里边装着什么！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371105"
            ]
          },
          "705371105": {
            "id": "705371105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "让我瞧瞧看…里边好像塞着很多…圆圆的，比日落果还大不少的，红色的球…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371106"
            ]
          },
          "705371106": {
            "id": "705371106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "等等，难道是炸弹？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371107"
            ]
          },
          "705371107": {
            "id": "705371107",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "骑士团为什么会在湖边放一箱炸弹啊？难道就是要用来炸那些…丽莎提到过的，入侵果酒湖的鱼？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7053713",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705371301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705371301": {
            "id": "705371301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "哇啊！好可怕！我们走！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705371302"
            ]
          },
          "705371302": {
            "id": "705371302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对对对，一整箱炸弹，怎么想都很危险，我们快离它远点！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7053714",
